  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Humanitarian support to KMSS as part of CAFOD Myanmar EQ DEC response</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project covers operational costs associated with CAFOD&apos;s support to KMSS in the Myanmar EQ humanitarian response. In particular, CAFOD staff (HSCO) will attend multiple training sessions with KMSS staff and community volunteers, training them on key standards such as CHS, AAP, PSEA, serious incident reporting, and gender sensitive programming.</narrative>
  </description>
